******************************************************************* When You have new project **********************************************************************************

First check which username and email is loggined :- 
git config user.name
git config user.email



Step :1 First choose your directory in windows powershell.

Step :2 Enter this command :- git init
this command create .gitignore file in your root directory.

अपनी .gitignore file में ये lines ज़रूर होनी चाहिए 👇
/node_modules
/vendor
/storage/*.key
/storage/logs/*
/public/storage
/public/hot
/public/build
/.idea
/.vscode
.env
*.zip
*.rar
*.log


Step :3 Enter Both Command (Files stage aur commit karo):-
git add .

Step :4 See Staged files
git status

Step :5 Create Comment
git commit -m "Initial commit - Laravel project"

Step :6 Create GitHub repo

GitHub pe login → New Repository
Name: havenholidayhome ya apka preferred name
Public/Private select karo → Create Repository

Step :7 Remote add karo
git remote add origin https://github.com/harshit82187/havenholidayhome.git

Step 8: Push project to GitHub
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main





******************************************************************* When You have existing project **********************************************************************************

if you work some and then push data in github

step 1 : check which file is updated 

git status 

(showing some file name which you added or updated)

Step 2 : git add .  (that command push everything )

if you want push  specific files so write this command 
git add src/pages/Register.js package.json package-lock.json

Step 3 : git commit -m "Implemented React Register module and fixed CORS issue"

Step 4 : git push origin main



*********************************************************************** if you showing any issue regarding github histoy ***************************************************************

Step 1: Fresh Git Init (Clean Push)
rmdir -r -force .git

Step 2: नया Git initialize करो
git init


Step 3: नया remote add करो
git remote add origin https://github.com/harshit82187/gaamraam-trust.git

Step 4: .gitignore ensure करो (Laravel के लिए सही वाला)
/node_modules
/vendor
/storage/*.key
/storage/logs/*
/public/storage
/public/hot
/public/build
/.idea
/.vscode
.env
*.zip
*.rar
*.log


Step 5: if you want add whole repo
git add .

If you want any particular folder 
git add app/

Step 6: Commit करो
git commit -m "Fresh start after removing large files"

Step 7: अब Push करो
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main --force



